{"evidence":["In a detached worktree at commit `56df5f8`, `cargo test -p tank_data --lib` fails to compile with 80 errors, including `crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs:180` (`AnimalState.adults_count` no longer exists), `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs:376` (`shrimp_biomass_g` arity mismatch), and downstream breakage in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` and `crates/tank_core/src/types/budget.rs`.","In a detached worktree at parent commit `3ef1754`, `cargo check -p tank_data --lib` succeeds, so the checkpoint introduced the regression rather than inheriting it unchanged.","`git diff --stat 3ef1754..56df5f8 -- ':(exclude).ralph-burning/**'` shows 23 source files changed, including unrelated `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` and `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` refactors in addition to the provenance files.","`ParamMeta` stores `notes` at `crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs:60-62`, but the developer-facing formatter only renders unit/confidence/source/range in `crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs:65-88` and `crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs:148-154`.","`param_meta` is an unchecked `BTreeMap<String, ParamMeta>` at `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs:385-388`; `check_ranges()` and `check_all_ranges()` skip unknown keys silently when `param_value()` returns `None` (`crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs:391-500`, `crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs:129-141`)."],"findings_or_gaps":["Build-breaking regression: the checkpoint bundles an unfinished AnimalState/stage-cohort/save migration refactor, so the tree no longer compiles and the claimed `tank_data`/`tank_core` test passes are not reproducible.","Completeness gap: the new display helper leaves `notes` write-only, so one of the requested provenance fields still cannot be surfaced in docs/debug output through the provided formatter.","Loader integrity gap: typoed or stale `param_meta` keys load successfully and are then ignored by range checking, which makes provenance attachment silently lossy instead of producing a clear diagnostic."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Re-cut the checkpoint so the provenance work is isolated from the unrelated stage-cohort/save migration changes, or finish the bundled refactor until `cargo test -p tank_data --lib` and `cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` pass from a clean worktree.","Extend the formatter/display helper and its tests so `notes` are rendered when present.","Add validation or warnings for unknown `param_meta` keys so misspelled parameter names fail fast or at least emit explicit diagnostics."],"outcome":"request_changes"}